stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IdentityChecking
    IdentityChecking --> BlockedIdentity: identity drift
    IdentityChecking --> CanaryChecking: identity bound
    CanaryChecking --> BlockedCanary: threshold / cohort fail
    CanaryChecking --> FlagChecking: canary passed
    FlagChecking --> BlockedFlag: mapping / kill switch fail
    FlagChecking --> RollbackChecking: flag bound
    RollbackChecking --> BlockedRollback: target / trigger / timeout missing
    RollbackChecking --> HealthChecking: rollback ready
    HealthChecking --> BlockedHealth: old run or readback mismatch
    HealthChecking --> PipelineReady: same run and digest
    PipelineReady --> Handoff: next owner decides
    Handoff --> [*]
